WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:02.160
<b>SAKAMOTO'S</b>

00:02.250 --> 00:04.420
<b>Readiness potential?</b>

00:04.500 --> 00:05.630
<b>The heck is that?</b>

00:07.170 --> 00:10.670
<b>Listen close. I'll explain it so simply
even a monkey could understand.</b>

00:11.420 --> 00:13.720
<b>By the time a person thinks about moving,</b>

00:13.800 --> 00:16.720
<b>their brain has already decided to move.</b>

00:17.220 --> 00:18.760
<b>What are you…</b>

00:19.810 --> 00:21.850
<b>You're talking about the subconscious.</b>

00:22.980 --> 00:23.810
<b>That's right.</b>

00:23.890 --> 00:25.400
<b>I see…</b>

00:25.480 --> 00:29.900
<b>I thought I had to think about punching
before deciding to punch.</b>

00:29.980 --> 00:33.070
<b>But I'm actually
subconsciously deciding to punch</b>

00:33.150 --> 00:35.820
<b>a split-second before my mind realizes it?</b>

00:35.910 --> 00:37.240
<b>My brilliant lady!</b>

00:37.320 --> 00:39.990
<b>I knew you would understand immediately!</b>

00:41.910 --> 00:45.870
<b>A split-second…
That could mean life or death.</b>

00:45.960 --> 00:46.830
<b>Yes.</b>

00:46.920 --> 00:51.000
<b>In other words,
if you can go beyond conscious thought</b>

00:51.090 --> 00:54.260
<b>and take advantage
of your opponent's readiness potential…</b>

01:00.220 --> 01:01.720
<b>I should thank you.</b>

01:03.060 --> 01:06.310
<b>When I was struggling
to block out your incessant thoughts,</b>

01:06.390 --> 01:08.770
<b>I found a new skill deep within myself.</b>

01:10.480 --> 01:14.240
<b>I won't let you hurt
the people I care about!</b>

01:21.950 --> 01:23.500
<b>This ends now!</b>

01:28.210 --> 01:29.880
<b><i>No…</i></b>

01:29.960 --> 01:32.630
<b><i>I overdid it…</i>
<i>I'm not used to my new ability yet.</i></b>

01:38.760 --> 01:39.640
<b><i>Damn--</i></b>

01:46.520 --> 01:49.060
<b>What a racket.</b>

01:50.360 --> 01:52.400
<b>You think you can come to my turf</b>

01:52.480 --> 01:56.150
<b>and mess with my family?</b>

01:57.030 --> 01:58.950
<b>You're dead meat.</b>

02:01.780 --> 02:02.910
<b><i>Who the hell?</i></b>

03:34.670 --> 03:37.960
<b>JUST DESSERTS</b>

03:38.050 --> 03:41.130
<b>What the hell… What happened to you?</b>

03:42.430 --> 03:43.640
<b>ABSOLUTE ETHANOL</b>

03:45.640 --> 03:47.180
<b>Absolute ethanol?</b>

03:49.600 --> 03:51.020
<b><i>She must've drunk it earlier!</i></b>

03:51.640 --> 03:53.390
<b><i>And now she's in Drunken Fist mode…</i></b>

03:54.020 --> 03:55.100
<b><i>But…</i></b>

03:55.190 --> 03:58.110
<b><i>She's acting different than the last time.</i></b>

03:58.190 --> 03:59.940
<b>EMOTIONAL DRUNK - ANGRY DRUNK
HAPPY DRUNK</b>

04:00.530 --> 04:05.450
<b>It's one thing after another with you two.
I don't get you at all.</b>

04:07.080 --> 04:10.200
<b>You must look down on us mafia folk, huh?</b>

04:11.040 --> 04:11.910
<b><i>No way!</i></b>

04:13.830 --> 04:15.670
<b><i>She's a mafia drunk?!</i></b>

04:15.750 --> 04:18.880
<b>Shin, it's about to go down.
Get outta the way.</b>

04:20.800 --> 04:21.710
<b>Die!</b>

04:31.390 --> 04:32.560
<b><i>Where'd she go?</i></b>

04:40.400 --> 04:45.030
<b>Get ready. For every person you've killed,</b>

04:45.110 --> 04:47.530
<b>I'm gonna cut off one of your fingers.</b>

04:47.620 --> 04:49.780
<b>Get off me, bitch!</b>

04:49.870 --> 04:51.200
<b>Who do you think you are--</b>

04:54.830 --> 04:57.540
<b>I didn't say you could talk.</b>

04:59.210 --> 05:00.960
<b>Goddamn, that hurts!</b>

05:01.550 --> 05:03.010
<b>Okay, okay.</b>

05:03.090 --> 05:05.050
<b>Please. I'm sorry.</b>

05:05.130 --> 05:07.470
<b>I'll never bother you guys again.</b>

05:08.050 --> 05:09.220
<b>"Please"?</b>

05:09.760 --> 05:13.730
<b>Have you ever listened
to someone who begged you for their life?</b>

05:19.560 --> 05:20.730
<b><i>I'm gonna die…</i></b>

05:20.820 --> 05:23.400
<b><i>No, I don't want this to be my ending!</i></b>

05:25.990 --> 05:27.820
<b>Stop! Don't come any closer!</b>

05:29.410 --> 05:32.580
<b><i>Bad endings are only fun</i>
<i>when they're happening to other people!</i></b>

05:32.660 --> 05:35.290
<b><i>No… I want to live longer!</i></b>

05:35.370 --> 05:37.920
<b><i>I want to kill so many more people!</i></b>

05:38.000 --> 05:39.880
<b>I couldn't help but overhear.</b>

05:42.000 --> 05:43.210
<b>You're done,</b>

05:43.800 --> 05:45.210
<b>you sick bastard!</b>

05:52.010 --> 05:55.520
<b>It's not how you die that matters…</b>

05:55.600 --> 05:56.810
<b>It's how you live!</b>

05:59.350 --> 06:02.270
<b>DEATH ROW INMATE SAW
RETIRED</b>

06:02.360 --> 06:05.280
<b>TENMON</b>

06:05.860 --> 06:08.110
<b><i>Well, what do you know?</i>
<i>One of those death row dolts</i></b>

06:08.200 --> 06:10.030
<b><i>got snuffed out</i>
<i>at some home improvement shop.</i></b>

06:10.110 --> 06:14.490
<b><i>Oh no… What do we do</i>
<i>if there are none left for us?</i></b>

06:15.080 --> 06:18.080
<b>What was the point
of this silly good-luck ritual?</b>

06:18.660 --> 06:21.750
<b>You said you wanted to have <i>tonkatsu.</i></b>

06:21.830 --> 06:22.920
<b>That was you.</b>

06:23.460 --> 06:25.340
<b>Well, enjoy your meal, then we'll--</b>

06:25.920 --> 06:27.760
<b>Oh? It's Nagumo.</b>

06:27.840 --> 06:29.050
<b><i>Hey there!</i></b>

06:29.130 --> 06:31.390
<b><i>I'm approaching my target now!</i></b>

06:31.470 --> 06:33.760
<b><i>Did you eat too much to get into position?</i></b>

06:33.850 --> 06:36.430
<b><i>If you feel bloated and need to rest,</i>
<i>just let me know!</i></b>

06:37.770 --> 06:40.690
<b>Looks like
our services may not be required.</b>

06:41.190 --> 06:42.480
<b>We can take it easy.</b>

06:42.560 --> 06:45.780
<b>I'll finish quickly
so we can look for some inmates.</b>

06:45.860 --> 06:48.360
<b>Don't wolf down your food.
That's bad manners.</b>

06:48.440 --> 06:50.910
<b>Mr. Shishiba, you can have the rest.</b>

06:51.490 --> 06:53.370
<b>Thank you for the meal.</b>

06:53.450 --> 06:54.620
<b>Careful, now.</b>

06:55.120 --> 06:57.450
<b>The ones who rush in are the first to die.</b>

06:57.540 --> 06:58.500
<b>I know.</b>

07:00.750 --> 07:03.250
<b>That girl really hates to lose.</b>

07:04.750 --> 07:08.920
<b>I can't eat two bowls of <i>katsudon.</i>
I'm already stuffed.</b>

07:09.420 --> 07:10.680
<b>Hmm?</b>

07:10.760 --> 07:13.470
<b>Now, this is unbelievable.</b>

07:13.550 --> 07:15.760
<b>How dare she!</b>

07:15.850 --> 07:17.100
<b>KATSUDON</b>

07:17.180 --> 07:20.270
<b>Why wouldn't she order it without onions?!</b>

07:30.990 --> 07:34.120
<b>SUZUKI
HOME IMPROVEMENT STORE</b>

07:34.200 --> 07:35.830
<b>Damn them!</b>

07:35.910 --> 07:38.830
<b>I'm not about to die here.</b>

07:38.910 --> 07:41.710
<b>I have so much killing left to do!</b>

07:41.790 --> 07:43.710
<b>TAXI STAND</b>

07:49.380 --> 07:51.130
<b>Take me to the airport.</b>

07:51.220 --> 07:54.050
<b>What? But I still have a passenger…</b>

07:54.140 --> 07:55.680
<b>Shut up! I'll kill you!</b>

07:55.760 --> 07:57.720
<b>-I don't mind sharing.
-All right!</b>

08:00.810 --> 08:01.890
<b><i>Okay.</i></b>

08:01.980 --> 08:05.560
<b><i>I'll steal some money</i>
<i>and lay low for a bit.</i></b>

08:05.650 --> 08:08.110
<b>You're in a rush.</b>

08:08.190 --> 08:13.070
<b>Yeah, sorry 'bout that.
Your destination will have to wait.</b>

08:13.820 --> 08:15.240
<b>No worries.</b>

08:16.070 --> 08:17.780
<b>I've just arrived.</b>

08:18.660 --> 08:19.790
<b>Buckle up!</b>

08:29.380 --> 08:31.760
<b>Hey, Lu! Come on, wake up!</b>

08:33.670 --> 08:35.970
<b>Huh? What happened to you, Shin?</b>

08:36.050 --> 08:37.010
<b>He's gone!</b>

08:37.090 --> 08:38.760
<b>We've gotta find him right away!</b>

08:40.810 --> 08:43.480
<b>Shin! What's wrong? Your head hurts?</b>

08:43.560 --> 08:46.270
<b><i>Is this an aftereffect of my new ability?</i></b>

08:46.350 --> 08:48.440
<b><i>Damn it. Why now?</i></b>

08:49.020 --> 08:50.690
<b>You mean Saw? He's dead.</b>

08:51.610 --> 08:55.240
<b>Christ. You had to make such a big mess
in a public place like this?</b>

08:55.320 --> 08:56.990
<b>FLOATERS
(JAA INCIDENT CLEANUP TROOP)</b>

08:57.070 --> 08:59.450
<b>Would it kill you to think about
us floaters for once?!</b>

08:59.530 --> 09:01.410
<b>Oh, they're floaters.</b>

09:01.490 --> 09:02.790
<b>What's a floater?</b>

09:03.450 --> 09:06.540
<b>Whenever hit men cause
collateral damage to the town,</b>

09:06.620 --> 09:08.880
<b>they fix things up
to how they were before.</b>

09:08.960 --> 09:10.590
<b>They're the JAA's cleanup squad.</b>

09:11.130 --> 09:14.010
<b>-God, this sucks.
-When am I gonna be promoted to hit man?</b>

09:14.090 --> 09:15.680
<b>They're a bunch of degenerates.</b>

09:15.760 --> 09:18.680
<b>Most of them do this part-time
while training to be hit men.</b>

09:18.760 --> 09:21.560
<b>Wait, speaking of degenerates… You!</b>

09:22.430 --> 09:24.560
<b>You got wasted on this stuff!</b>

09:24.640 --> 09:27.400
<b>Oh, yeah! That was fun!</b>

09:27.480 --> 09:29.690
<b>Wait, what about our shopping?</b>

09:31.110 --> 09:34.190
<b>Oh, crap!
We've gotta get back to the store!</b>

09:38.660 --> 09:40.240
<b>OFFERING</b>

09:45.410 --> 09:47.370
<b><i>I like this.</i></b>

09:48.670 --> 09:50.210
<b><i>Let's see…</i></b>

09:50.290 --> 09:52.210
<b><i>How do I phrase this?</i></b>

09:53.090 --> 09:56.090
<b><i>I pray that I'll be able</i>
<i>to kill the death row inmates.</i></b>

10:06.060 --> 10:07.230
<b>I find it strange.</b>

10:08.020 --> 10:11.520
<b>Why do people close their eyes
when they pray?</b>

10:16.900 --> 10:20.070
<b>Wow, my prayer was answered right away.</b>

10:22.120 --> 10:24.410
<b>Thank you, gods.</b>

10:24.490 --> 10:25.750
<b>Oh, my.</b>

10:25.830 --> 10:29.330
<b>Just my luck, running into
the ugliest person on the list.</b>

10:30.170 --> 10:34.550
<b>Do you know
how we pray to the gods in Japan?</b>

10:34.630 --> 10:35.630
<b>What?</b>

10:41.090 --> 10:42.050
<b>Bow twice…</b>

10:47.100 --> 10:48.390
<b>Clap twice…</b>

10:54.980 --> 10:56.360
<b>Then bow again.</b>

10:59.030 --> 11:01.530
<b>You're supposed to
make your offering before that.</b>

11:06.830 --> 11:07.870
<b>I've got it.</b>

11:08.450 --> 11:12.330
<b>I'm gonna make you the cutest one of all.</b>

11:14.710 --> 11:18.170
<b>Osaragi… Where'd that girl get off to?</b>

11:29.100 --> 11:30.430
<b>Come here…</b>

11:31.140 --> 11:33.940
<b>I'm gonna make you the cutest one of all.</b>

11:34.020 --> 11:35.900
<b>I need you to die.</b>

11:36.440 --> 11:38.190
<b>In the name of The Order.</b>

11:39.070 --> 11:40.320
<b><i>Echidna.</i></b>

11:40.900 --> 11:43.450
<b>I've had enough of you barbarians!</b>

11:46.830 --> 11:50.910
<b>All I did was love people.</b>

11:51.000 --> 11:56.090
<b>How cruel to be imprisoned
and given the death sentence for that!</b>

11:57.170 --> 11:59.800
<b>You're a killer too. We're no different.</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:02.970
<b>So what gives you the right
to cast judgment on me?</b>

12:03.050 --> 12:05.970
<b>Judgment? It's not as grand as all that.</b>

12:06.760 --> 12:10.020
<b>It's more like there's a bug in the house
and I have to kill it.</b>

12:10.100 --> 12:12.270
<b>That's all.</b>

12:12.810 --> 12:15.350
<b>The JAA is my house,</b>

12:15.440 --> 12:16.690
<b>and The Order is…</b>

12:17.230 --> 12:18.480
<b>Um…</b>

12:18.570 --> 12:20.610
<b><i>A fly swatter?</i></b>

12:20.690 --> 12:23.740
<b><i>You know, the electric kind.</i></b>

12:32.830 --> 12:34.250
<b>Is this your weapon?</b>

12:35.170 --> 12:37.920
<b>What a heavy bag you're lugging around.</b>

12:43.260 --> 12:44.220
<b>Damn, it's heavy!</b>

12:45.800 --> 12:47.010
<b>What's the matter?</b>

12:47.090 --> 12:49.430
<b>Come on, hit me like you did before!</b>

12:50.010 --> 12:52.180
<b>Can't get near me
without your precious weapon?</b>

12:55.270 --> 12:57.560
<b><i>One in each palm,</i></b>

12:57.650 --> 12:59.520
<b><i>and six in her torso.</i></b>

13:00.070 --> 13:03.570
<b><i>I see… That's where she keeps them.</i></b>

13:04.240 --> 13:07.280
<b><i>They're like backscratchers. Weird.</i></b>

13:07.360 --> 13:09.580
<b><i>I wonder if she hides them</i>
<i>between her bones.</i></b>

13:11.490 --> 13:15.120
<b><i>What should I do?</i>
<i>I'd rather not get too close…</i></b>

13:15.210 --> 13:17.290
<b><i>I didn't bring any bandages with me.</i></b>

13:20.880 --> 13:24.720
<b>Wanna pray to the gods now?</b>

13:24.800 --> 13:28.340
<b>Thanks for showing me how to do it!</b>

13:37.650 --> 13:39.940
<b>First a bag, now a human?</b>

13:40.020 --> 13:41.070
<b>That bitch…</b>

13:46.110 --> 13:47.740
<b>That's not how you use that.</b>

13:47.820 --> 13:49.740
<b>She must be hot.</b>

13:49.820 --> 13:53.700
<b>Kicking the bell at a shrine?
You're in for some divine retribution.</b>

13:54.290 --> 13:55.750
<b>Retribution?</b>

13:56.370 --> 13:59.750
<b>There's no such thing. The gods are kind.</b>

13:59.830 --> 14:00.670
<b>FORTUNE</b>

14:02.210 --> 14:03.630
<b>GOOD LUCK MAY COME</b>

14:03.710 --> 14:05.300
<b>Good luck may come…</b>

14:13.140 --> 14:14.930
<b>I've always found it strange.</b>

14:15.470 --> 14:18.020
<b>If I were a god,</b>

14:18.100 --> 14:21.610
<b>I'd never create people like you or me.</b>

14:22.520 --> 14:25.230
<b>Be more afraid, you ugly wretch.</b>

14:25.820 --> 14:27.440
<b>The gods are far too kind.</b>

14:28.400 --> 14:29.410
<b>So…</b>

14:33.780 --> 14:37.200
<b>we maintain order in exchange.</b>

14:39.580 --> 14:43.250
<b>Filthy murderers don't need to pray.</b>

14:49.760 --> 14:53.640
<b><i>My love has always been one-sided.</i></b>

14:56.520 --> 14:57.810
<b>I like you!</b>

14:58.430 --> 15:00.640
<b><i>Is it a sin to desire undying devotion?</i></b>

15:00.730 --> 15:03.110
<b>I like you. Will you go out with me?</b>

15:03.190 --> 15:05.020
<b>Sure. I like you too.</b>

15:06.110 --> 15:10.530
<b><i>I want the ones I love</i>
<i>to have thoughts only for me.</i></b>

15:10.610 --> 15:12.660
<b>I love you, Dump.</b>

15:12.740 --> 15:14.660
<b>We're besties, right?</b>

15:14.740 --> 15:16.080
<b>I like you!</b>

15:16.870 --> 15:19.160
<b><i>So I strike fear into their hearts.</i></b>

15:19.790 --> 15:21.960
<b><i>When someone is afraid,</i></b>

15:22.040 --> 15:26.170
<b><i>their lies and pretenses fall away,</i>
<i>and they think only of me.</i></b>

15:27.420 --> 15:28.710
<b><i>But…</i></b>

15:28.800 --> 15:32.590
<b><i>Why does it feel so hollow?</i></b>

15:35.850 --> 15:39.600
<b><i>Once they're dead,</i>
<i>they stop thinking of me or anything else.</i></b>

15:41.190 --> 15:43.100
<b><i>Heartbreak is brutal.</i></b>

15:58.950 --> 16:00.750
<b><i>It's time to find</i></b>

16:01.870 --> 16:03.000
<b><i>my next lover.</i></b>

16:27.150 --> 16:29.400
<b>Why me?</b>

16:29.480 --> 16:31.860
<b>All I ever did was love people!</b>

16:32.490 --> 16:34.070
<b>Just like everyone else!</b>

16:34.950 --> 16:36.660
<b>Like everyone else?</b>

16:36.740 --> 16:39.950
<b>I only ever wanted to be loved!</b>

16:40.540 --> 16:42.870
<b>You and I are killers.</b>

16:45.290 --> 16:46.380
<b>But…</b>

16:46.960 --> 16:48.880
<b>It's because of people like you…</b>

16:54.010 --> 16:57.640
<b>that I have reason to live each day.</b>

16:59.720 --> 17:01.180
<b>Thank you.</b>

17:03.270 --> 17:04.560
<b>I love you.</b>

17:21.370 --> 17:22.370
<b>Beautiful…</b>

17:34.300 --> 17:35.630
<b>Hey, Taro!</b>

17:35.720 --> 17:38.090
<b>Those pesky inmates are hard to find.</b>

17:38.680 --> 17:40.800
<b>What? No, it's fine.</b>

17:40.890 --> 17:43.970
<b>I can't sit back
while my friends are being attacked.</b>

17:44.520 --> 17:46.640
<b>I'll call you again when I find 'em.</b>

17:49.480 --> 17:52.610
<b>They look so weird,
you'd think they'd be easy to find.</b>

17:55.110 --> 17:56.150
<b>Anyway…</b>

17:57.030 --> 17:59.410
<b>So this is how Piisuke sees the world!</b>

18:00.570 --> 18:04.290
<b>Wish I always got to enjoy this view!</b>

18:08.750 --> 18:12.750
<b>Nice! This is, like, super Piisuke view!</b>

18:12.840 --> 18:16.090
<b>Where are you, little inmates?</b>

18:24.810 --> 18:28.190
<b>Yes. About the death row inmates…</b>

18:28.270 --> 18:31.190
<b>Two of them have been killed already.</b>

18:31.270 --> 18:35.440
<b>But overall, things are proceeding
according to plan. Yes.</b>

18:36.360 --> 18:38.990
<b>We've successfully drawn
The Order's attention,</b>

18:39.070 --> 18:41.950
<b>so let us use this opening
to move on to the next phase.</b>

18:43.080 --> 18:45.620
<b>Yes. Forward…</b>

18:45.700 --> 18:47.960
<b>in the noble name of justice.</b>

18:49.040 --> 18:50.170
<b>Who's on the phone?</b>

18:57.170 --> 18:59.380
<b>What is your objective?</b>

18:59.470 --> 19:02.680
<b>Well, well. If it isn't inmate Apart.</b>

19:02.760 --> 19:05.140
<b>Whatever do you mean?</b>

19:05.220 --> 19:07.520
<b>Oh, you're trying to brush me off.</b>

19:08.180 --> 19:09.390
<b>I wanna die.</b>

19:09.480 --> 19:12.400
<b>You aren't trying to understand me.</b>

19:12.480 --> 19:13.940
<b>I guess it's true.</b>

19:14.020 --> 19:18.900
<b>You'll never truly understand someone
until you make them spill their guts.</b>

19:18.990 --> 19:22.660
<b>I'm grateful to you
for getting me out of prison,</b>

19:22.740 --> 19:25.330
<b>but I won't let myself be used by you.</b>

19:26.740 --> 19:30.500
<b>I'm going to live my life my own way,
the same way I always have.</b>

19:30.580 --> 19:34.960
<b>Damn you… You were not to harm
anyone other than those on the list.</b>

19:35.040 --> 19:36.960
<b>That was the deal.</b>

19:44.720 --> 19:45.930
<b>I want…</b>

19:46.510 --> 19:51.020
<b>I want to understand more people.
More and more and more and more.</b>

19:56.230 --> 19:57.980
<b>How did it come to this?</b>

19:58.070 --> 19:59.860
<b>I underestimated him.</b>

19:59.940 --> 20:02.280
<b>He is much too dangerous.</b>

20:02.360 --> 20:05.990
<b>He will interfere with our plans
unless we put a stop to him.</b>

20:06.070 --> 20:08.290
<b><i>It's fine, Kashima.</i></b>

20:10.040 --> 20:12.660
<b><i>Let's let him do as he wishes.</i></b>

20:12.750 --> 20:15.290
<b>I apologize that you had to hear that.</b>

20:15.960 --> 20:17.210
<b>No, it's all right.</b>

20:17.840 --> 20:19.880
<b>There's no reward without some risk.</b>

20:20.420 --> 20:23.550
<b>This is just what we need
to get the jump on the JAA.</b>

20:24.510 --> 20:27.470
<b><i>Let them keep wreaking havoc.</i></b>

20:27.550 --> 20:28.560
<b>SAKAMOTO'S</b>

20:28.640 --> 20:30.930
<b>Is Shin going to be all right?</b>

20:31.730 --> 20:33.310
<b>Really? That's great!</b>

20:33.390 --> 20:35.060
<b>Everything's fine over here.</b>

20:35.730 --> 20:37.610
<b>We haven't had any customers yet.</b>

20:38.730 --> 20:40.980
<b>Yep! I'll be fine on my own.</b>

20:41.070 --> 20:43.320
<b>You take care too-- Oh, sorry.</b>

20:43.990 --> 20:45.570
<b>A customer just came in. Gotta go.</b>

20:46.950 --> 20:47.820
<b>Welcome!</b>

20:53.250 --> 20:55.330
<b>Can I help you find something?</b>

22:31.970 --> 22:33.890
<b>You can do it, Daddy!</b>

22:33.970 --> 22:35.770
<b>Careful, don't fall!</b>

22:35.850 --> 22:37.600
<b>More to your right!</b>

22:39.640 --> 22:42.020
<b>You're almost there, Daddy!</b>

22:42.110 --> 22:44.070
<b>Let's pull a little prank.</b>

22:44.150 --> 22:46.320
<b>Seriously? He'll kill us.</b>

22:46.400 --> 22:47.900
<b>It'll be fine.</b>

22:47.990 --> 22:51.530
<b>Regular <i>suikawari</i>
is too easy for Mr. Manager.</b>

22:55.790 --> 22:58.790
<b>Just go straight forward, Mr. Sakamoto!</b>

22:58.870 --> 23:01.170
<b><i>He's enjoying this more than I thought!</i></b>

23:05.250 --> 23:07.670
<b>SCENT DETECTED</b>

23:17.970 --> 23:20.560
<b>-It's so sweet!
-Yeah!</b>

23:22.150 --> 23:22.980
<b>Shin!</b>

23:23.060 --> 23:24.520
<b>-This is delicious!
-So good!</b>

23:24.610 --> 23:25.610
<b>Subtitle translation by: Joshua Kizuki</b>
